\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Overview of ArTE-VLA{}, illustrated for the dual-view LIBERO~\cite  {libero} setting. (a) Workspace and wrist RGB observations, the instruction, and robot state form the original \ensuremath  {\pi _{0.5}}{}~\cite  {pi05} prefix $X_t$. (b) Masked pooling and an implicit target head seed a four-horizon autoregressive effect chain; each hidden state and predicted 13-D effect are projected into an effect token. (c) The effect tokens augment $X_t$ and condition the flow-matching action expert, which generates the complete action chunk. The dashed path denotes simulator-derived effect supervision and validity masks.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:overview}{{2}{3}{}{figure.2}{}}
