\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {II}{\ignorespaces Success (\%) on LIBERO-Object~\cite  {libero} and RoboCasa PickPlace-5~\cite  {robocasa2024} across three rollout seeds. Entries are means across rollout seeds. For each rollout seed, LIBERO-Object~\cite  {libero} includes 50 paired episodes per task and RoboCasa PickPlace-5~\cite  {robocasa2024} includes 20. The reported ArTE-VLA{} setting uses $\lambda _E=1$ on LIBERO-Object~\cite  {libero} and $\lambda _E=0.1$ on RoboCasa PickPlace-5~\cite  {robocasa2024}.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
